    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67654" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῐαίφον-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		(parox.) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bloodthirsty,
				murderous</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> always epith. of Ares, <i><span class="en">
				5.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				455
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				844
			</span></i>, al.: coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρασύχειρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				<u>Scol.Oxy.</u>
				5.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. μύσος</span> pollution <i>of
				murder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				335
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τέκνων</span>
			<i>murderess</i> of thy children, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1346
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτερος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				266
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				881
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῐαιφόν-νως</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Memn.
				1.4
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ώτατα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				79.3
			</span></i>.</div>
